     cosmetic artifact of the ALREADY-SHIPPED KD-signed living/
     healthcare code path (unchanged by CB2), not a CB2 regression.
     Checked formatMoney (templates/render.go): `negative := v < 0` is
     false for -0.0 (IEEE754 -0.0 < 0.0 is false), so the template layer
     already neutralizes this to "$0.00", not "-$0.00" -- no user-visible
     defect.
   - %-change chart, refund month as BASE: hand-verified both ends by
